{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>So that it may be mine.</b> This." "<b>For a witness.</b> A feminine form of עֵדוּת, as in ״וְעֵדָה הַמַּצֵּבָה״ (Genesis 31)." "<b>For I have dug the well.</b> The shepherds of Avimelech were quarreling over it, saying, 'We dug it.' They agreed among themselves: whoever the waters rise toward when he approaches the well — it is his. And they rose toward Avraham."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:52.361341561Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}